
AquaStream360 Topographical Analysis Module – User Guide

1. Introduction
What is the Topographical Analysis Module?
A professional terrain analysis tool designed for water infrastructure planning. It transforms complex elevation data into actionable insights for network planning, pipeline routing, and construction assessment.
Why It Matters
•	Accurate analysis from Digital Elevation Models (DEMs)
•	Integrated water network visualization over real terrain
•	Data-driven insights for pipeline routing, pump stations, and construction
•	Multi-dimensional visualization for comprehensive understanding
Who Should Use This Module
•	Users designing water distribution networks
•	Users planning infrastructure upgrades
•	Users assessing construction feasibility
•	Environmental consultants analyzing watersheds
•	Municipal planners developing water systems
