5. Core Functionality
Loading DEM Data
•	Formats: GeoTIFF (.tif/.tiff), ASCII Grid (.asc)
•	Process: Click Load DEM, select file → data automatically processed
•	On load: Statistics calculated, multiple visualization formats generated, tools activated
Terrain Visualization
•	Change color schemes (Terrain, Viridis, Gray Scale, Rainbow)
•	Add overlays (Hillshade, Slope, Aspect, Curvature, Roughness)
•	Adjust overlay opacity
Elevation Extraction
•	Single points: Click on map
•	Multiple points: Use Extract Elevations, select coordinate file, process, export results
Terrain Analysis Tools
•	Hillshade, slope, contours, statistics, volume calculations
•	Advanced analyses in Analysis tab (slope zones, drainage, construction difficulty)
