9. Best Practices
Data Preparation
•	Ensure DEM CRS matches network coordinates
•	Use appropriate resolution:
o	Regional: 30–90 m
o	Site: 1–10 m
o	Detailed engineering: <1 m
•	Crop to area of interest for performance
Workflow Optimization
1.	Load DEM → check statistics
2.	Apply hillshade, explore 3D
3.	Analyze slopes and ruggedness
4.	Overlay water network
5.	Extract critical elevations
6.	Generate reports and export visualizations
Interpretation Guidelines
•	Slope: 0–2° flat, 2–5° gentle, 5–15° moderate, 15–30° steep, >30° very steep
•	Elevation zones: valleys, lower slopes, mid slopes, upper slopes
