10. Technical Support
Common Issues
•	DEM load errors → verify format and CRS
•	Slow performance → reduce DEM resolution, close apps
•	Network not displaying → ensure Show Network is checked
•	Coordinate mismatch → verify DEM and network CRS
Getting Help
•	User Guide, online knowledge base, tutorial videos
