11. Appendices
Glossary
•	DEM – Digital Elevation Model
•	Hillshade – Simulated sunlight for terrain
•	Slope – Terrain steepness
•	Aspect – Direction of slope
•	Curvature – Concave/convex/flat terrain
•	Roughness – Terrain irregularity
•	CRS – Coordinate Reference System
•	UTM / WGS84 – Standard projected/geographic CRS
•	Node – Network point (source, junction, consumer)
•	Link/Edge – Connection between nodes

